<title>HONG KONG: Credit Lyonnais sets Shanghai Petchem warrants.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais sets Shanghai Petchem warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais said it has launched 1.5 billion American-style call warrants on shares of Shanghai Petrochemical Company Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$1.791     PREMIUM	 15.5 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.050745  GEARING	 3.92X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  10.SEP.97    PAYDATE	 23.SEP.96</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    MIN EXER LOT  20,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$1.99</p>
<p> NOTES		 GOVERNING LAW IS HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
